<% content_for :meta_title, "FAQ | Working with Doug Morgen" %>
<% content_for :meta_description, "How engagements with Doug Morgen work: process, timelines, team fit, and project vs fractional CTO support." %>

<section class="section-block">
  <div class="section-shell max-w-5xl">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 sm:text-5xl">FAQ: How working together works</h1>
    <p class="mt-4 max-w-3xl text-lg text-slate-700">Simple process, direct communication, and clear outcomes. No bloated discovery cycles.</p>

    <div class="mt-8 grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm" open>
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">What happens after I submit the form?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">I review your goals, current systems, and constraints, then follow up with recommended next steps and whether this is best as project work or fractional CTO support.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">How quickly can we start?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Most engagements can start quickly once scope is aligned. If timing is urgent, call that out in your message and timeline field.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">Do you work with existing teams?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Yes. I can plug into your current engineering, operations, and leadership workflows, or run delivery directly where you need extra leverage.</p>
      </details>

      <details class="rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-5 shadow-sm">
        <summary class="cursor-pointer text-base font-semibold text-slate-900">What kinds of engagements do you offer?</summary>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-slate-700">Project-based builds, technical rescue work, and fractional/half-time CTO support focused on practical execution and shipping useful software.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10">
      <%= link_to "Start a project", start_project_path, class: "btn-primary" %>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
